er-based models. ; A method that achieves competitive performances while significantly reducing the model size and shortening the inference time of original BERT BASE. ; A model whose effectiveness is demonstrated on question answering tasks. ; A student model that learns from the teacher BERT.\n', 'Name:TWO-STAGE LEARNING FRAMEWORK\nDescription:A framework for TinyBERT that performs Transformer distillation at both the pretraining and task-specific learning stages. ; A framework used for TinyBERT, involving pre-training and distillation stages.\n', 'Name:GLUE BENCHMARK\nDescription:A benchmark used to evaluate the performance of language models on various natural language processing tasks. ; A benchmark used to evaluate the performance of natural language processing models on various tasks. ; A benchmark used to evaluate the performance of natural language processing models on various tasks. ; A benchmark used to evaluate the performance of natural language processing models, such as BERT, XLNet, RoBERTa, and SpanBERT.\n', 'Name:PRE-TRAINED LANGUAGE MODELS (PLMS)\nDescription:Language models pre-trained on large datasets and then fine-tuned on downstream tasks, representing a new paradigm for natural language processing.\n']split_entities: text_tokens=4022, instructions_tokens=500, budget_for_entities=5478, number_of_entities=119, avg_entity_tokens=46, max_entities=119, num_groups=1, entities_per_group=[119]
